---
description: How to show run difficulty to guests
alwaysApply: true
---

Guests read difficulty from the trail map symbols, not words. Show every difficulty with `<DifficultyIcon difficulty={...} />`: green circle, blue square, black diamond, double black diamond.
Never print "beginner," "intermediate," "advanced," or "expert" where a guest can see it.

Do:    <DifficultyIcon difficulty={run.difficulty} />
Don't: <span>{formatDifficulty(trail.difficulty)}</span>

See @components/DifficultyIcon.tsx.
